 not found'\nand no attach; inside tmux, a cross-server jump detached the client first\n(pulling the user out of pi) then failed the reattach the same way.\n\nSingle-quote the target with = inside the quotes. switch-client stays a\ndirect exec.Command arg (no shell), so it's left unquoted.","timestamp":"2026-09-02T04:46:22Z","author":{"name":"Court Schuett","email":"court@subaud.io"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1300559398,"node_id":"R_kgDOTYT2Jg","name":"tackle","full_name":"schuettc/tackle","private":false,"owner":{"login":"schuettc","id":71404236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDA0MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71404236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc","html_url":"https://github.com/schuettc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/schuettc/tackle","description":"A fast, keyboard-first per-worktree markdown scratchpad TUI (Go / Bubble Tea)","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schuettc/tackle","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schuettc/tackle/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schuettc/tackle/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schuettc/tackle/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schuettc/ta